WEBVTT

00:06.381 --> 00:09.217
[woman in eerie singsong]
♪ Hangman ♪

00:09.217 --> 00:11.594
- [cell door clangs]
- [woman chuckling]

00:11.594 --> 00:14.347
- [prisoners clamoring]
- [woman whistling]

00:14.347 --> 00:16.599
- [keychain rattling]
- [lock clicking]

00:16.599 --> 00:19.561
[woman vocalizing eerily]

00:19.561 --> 00:21.479
- [man] Sofia...
- [cell door clunking]

00:22.605 --> 00:25.108
Sofia, you need to go inside.

00:25.108 --> 00:26.943
[prisoners clamoring]

00:26.943 --> 00:28.111
[cell door clangs]

00:28.111 --> 00:30.864
[prisoners laughing maniacally]

00:30.864 --> 00:33.825
[cell door whirring]

00:35.618 --> 00:36.870
[Alberto] Sofia...

00:37.495 --> 00:39.497
- [cell door clangs]
- [voices subside]

00:41.458 --> 00:42.667
[Sofia gasps softly]

00:44.461 --> 00:45.837
[chains rattling]

00:47.047 --> 00:48.173
You're here.

00:49.632 --> 00:50.467
[Sofia sighs]

00:50.467 --> 00:52.385
[breathing rapidly]

00:53.178 --> 00:55.138
[eerie music playing]

00:55.138 --> 00:56.931
Alberto, your finger...

00:56.931 --> 00:58.558
I swear to God,

00:58.683 --> 01:00.435
one day,
I'll get you outta here.

01:03.521 --> 01:05.774
Berto, behind you!
Berto! Berto!

01:05.774 --> 01:07.275
No, no, no, no, no!

01:07.275 --> 01:08.860
[gasping]

01:09.527 --> 01:10.987
[clanging]

01:10.987 --> 01:13.114
- [intense music playing]
- [loud droning]

01:13.114 --> 01:15.283
- [breathing rapidly]
- [muffled gunshot]

01:15.283 --> 01:17.619
[loud droning continues]

01:17.619 --> 01:19.871
- [muffled] No!
- [hyperventilating]

01:20.372 --> 01:21.581
[man] Sofia...

01:21.706 --> 01:22.540
[music fades]

01:22.665 --> 01:23.625
You're safe.

01:23.625 --> 01:26.211
[Sofia breathing rapidly]

01:26.711 --> 01:27.629
[device clicks]

01:30.048 --> 01:32.092
It's okay. It's okay.

01:32.092 --> 01:34.427
Get off of me! [grunting]

01:34.427 --> 01:35.845
Sofia... Sofia!

01:35.845 --> 01:37.597
- Sofia, it's okay.
- [clattering]

01:37.722 --> 01:40.016
- [Sofia yells]
- Sofia... Okay, okay...

01:40.016 --> 01:41.601
Deep breaths. Come on.

01:41.726 --> 01:43.228
- Deep breaths.
- [gasping]

01:44.729 --> 01:45.772
Count with me.

01:46.439 --> 01:48.817
[inhales, then exhales]

01:50.235 --> 01:51.611
[softly] In for four...

01:51.736 --> 01:52.987
[inhales]

01:55.615 --> 01:56.616
[Sofia exhales]

01:56.741 --> 01:58.076
And then out...

01:59.244 --> 02:00.787
[Sofia inhales shakily]

02:02.247 --> 02:04.332
[exhales]

02:04.332 --> 02:05.375
[sighs]

02:05.375 --> 02:06.668
There you go.

02:08.211 --> 02:09.087
Good.

02:09.754 --> 02:12.257
Do you see the pictures
on the wall?

02:14.259 --> 02:15.301
[Sofia softly] Uh-huh.

02:15.969 --> 02:17.470
The items on my desk?

02:23.393 --> 02:26.521
[Sofia breathes steadily]

02:27.647 --> 02:28.940
[Sofia exhales sharply]

02:30.567 --> 02:32.152
You're not in Arkham anymore.

02:34.654 --> 02:35.780
You're safe.

02:43.121 --> 02:44.873
[Sofia breathing rapidly]

02:44.873 --> 02:47.375
- [Julian] Tell me what you saw.
- [Sofia] I have to go.

02:49.461 --> 02:51.004
I can help you, Sofia.

02:51.129 --> 02:52.213
You're safe.

02:56.009 --> 02:57.344
I'm not safe.

02:57.344 --> 02:59.554
[dramatic music playing]

03:00.638 --> 03:01.973
I'm home.

03:07.228 --> 03:11.149
[dramatic music swells]

03:13.109 --> 03:15.028
[rain pattering]

03:17.614 --> 03:20.158
[somber music playing]

03:30.001 --> 03:32.671
[dramatic music building]

03:36.800 --> 03:37.926
[music fades]

03:37.926 --> 03:40.220
[door lock buzzes]

03:41.179 --> 03:43.098
[inmates chattering]

03:44.391 --> 03:46.393
[door closes, locks]

03:46.393 --> 03:48.269
Didn't know I was walkin'
into a party.

03:48.895 --> 03:51.022
- I woulda brought something.
- You cocky motherfucker.

03:51.147 --> 03:53.191
Tryin' to force my hand
to take a fall for you?

03:53.316 --> 03:56.528
I ain't forcing nothin', Sal.
I saw an opportunity, is all.

03:56.653 --> 03:57.904
The streets are talkin' again!

03:58.530 --> 03:59.989
They know there's only
one man big enough

03:59.989 --> 04:01.324
to go against Falcones,

04:01.324 --> 04:03.451
Salvatore motherfuckin' Maroni.

04:03.910 --> 04:05.203
You want the credit.

04:05.328 --> 04:07.038
You deserve the credit.
And it's yours.

04:08.206 --> 04:12.127
Or... I could drop your name
to the Falcones right now

04:12.669 --> 04:14.754
and stop this war you've
brought on my Family.

04:15.505 --> 04:16.923
Tell 'em it was you
that whacked Alberto

04:17.048 --> 04:19.092
and watch 'em slice you
from earhole to asshole.

04:19.092 --> 04:22.554
Well, yeah, I mean,
that's another way to go.

04:24.347 --> 04:26.349
But you're wearin' that ring
around here, Sal.

04:26.349 --> 04:28.226
You're already gloatin'.

04:29.019 --> 04:30.395
You might as well lean in.

04:32.105 --> 04:33.064
Listen...

04:33.690 --> 04:36.234
The Falcones are still
lickin' their wounds.

04:37.193 --> 04:38.611
They're distracted.

04:38.611 --> 04:40.905
And I got the inside track
with the new Don.

04:41.573 --> 04:43.783
They brought in
Carmine's brother, Luca.

04:43.783 --> 04:46.453
He's a fuckin' pussy,
but I got his ear.

04:47.787 --> 04:48.747
This can work.

04:49.789 --> 04:52.292
We can take 'em all down, Sal.

04:54.586 --> 04:56.087
But you gotta do your part.

04:56.212 --> 04:57.839
[uneasy music playing]

04:58.715 --> 05:01.801
[in Farsi]

05:08.266 --> 05:09.809
[in English] I claim Alberto,

05:09.809 --> 05:12.145
you make good
on the Drops you promised.

05:14.230 --> 05:16.316
This is Ervad, one of my capos.

05:17.067 --> 05:18.735
- He'll run point.
- It's a simple route.

05:18.735 --> 05:20.612
Straight shot to Robbinsville.

05:20.737 --> 05:22.614
No highways. All neighborhoods.

05:22.739 --> 05:23.865
Nice work, boys. Do it up.

05:23.865 --> 05:25.367
[Oz] Usin' the FEMA truck
as our cover,

05:25.367 --> 05:26.951
and the Drops'll
be sittin' pretty

05:27.077 --> 05:28.953
inside barrels
of "Emergency Water."

05:30.121 --> 05:31.373
Hey, Castillo.

05:32.457 --> 05:33.750
No hard feelings, right?

05:33.750 --> 05:36.086
We're all on the same side.

05:36.086 --> 05:37.170
[barrel clangs]

05:37.170 --> 05:38.588
Yeah, sure, Oz.

05:38.588 --> 05:41.132
- Yeah.
- Good.

05:41.257 --> 05:44.094
[Oz] Everyone in the lead car
and truck, they're patsies.

05:44.094 --> 05:46.554
You waste 'em,
you get your drugs

05:46.554 --> 05:47.681
and some blood.

05:47.681 --> 05:49.307
- That it?
- [man] Yeah.

05:50.183 --> 05:52.560
Alright, lock it up.
Let's head out!

05:53.311 --> 05:54.813
But the follow car,
that's where I'll be.

05:54.938 --> 05:56.481
You don't fuckin' touch that.

05:56.606 --> 05:58.483
I'll be there making sure
that you get what's yours

05:58.608 --> 05:59.859
without a hitch.

05:59.984 --> 06:01.319
- Sound good?
- Yeah.

06:01.444 --> 06:02.320
Boom.

06:02.821 --> 06:03.905
Everything goes simple.

06:04.781 --> 06:05.824
Penguin!

06:08.660 --> 06:10.578
[tense music playing]

06:13.123 --> 06:14.457
You're on the truck
with the product.

06:14.457 --> 06:15.959
Johnny. Nice to see you, too.

06:15.959 --> 06:18.712
But listen, I got it all set.

06:18.837 --> 06:20.255
I'm in the, uh, follow car.

06:20.255 --> 06:22.007
The truck is packed.
Ready to go. All good--

06:22.132 --> 06:23.258
[Viti] The fuck's your head at?

06:23.258 --> 06:24.426
We're in the middle
of a gang war.

06:24.426 --> 06:25.552
I'm doin' what I was told.

06:25.677 --> 06:27.012
Ain't my idea to close shop

06:27.137 --> 06:28.471
and move the product
to Robbinsville.

06:28.471 --> 06:30.515
We're adding artillery
to every vehicle.

06:30.640 --> 06:32.851
And your operation... Right?

06:32.976 --> 06:34.686
That's what you said,
it's your operation.

06:34.811 --> 06:36.187
...means you're on the truck.

06:39.190 --> 06:40.734
- Let's go.
- [vehicle doors shut]

06:40.859 --> 06:42.902
[dramatic music playing]

06:42.902 --> 06:45.363
[engines revving]

06:57.167 --> 06:58.418
[weapon cocking]

07:08.178 --> 07:09.471
[tires screeching]

07:09.471 --> 07:11.973
[engines revving]

07:17.562 --> 07:18.980
They're at the underpass.

07:18.980 --> 07:20.148
Get ready.

07:20.148 --> 07:21.358
[cocking]

07:21.358 --> 07:23.651
[engine revving]

07:28.907 --> 07:32.243
Hey, why do seagulls
fly over the sea?

07:34.788 --> 07:36.581
'Cause if they flew
over the bay,

07:36.706 --> 07:38.833
they'd be bagels. [laughs]

07:38.833 --> 07:41.419
You get it?
Bagels! Like the bread.

07:41.544 --> 07:43.254
Yeah, I get it now, Ray.

07:43.797 --> 07:45.256
Thanks for the explanation.

07:45.799 --> 07:49.010
[engines thrumming]

07:50.887 --> 07:53.598
[engines revving]

07:56.976 --> 07:58.228
Hey, I got one for ya.

07:58.228 --> 08:00.230
["Call Me Irresponsible"
by Bobby Darin plays]

08:00.230 --> 08:03.066
What's the difference between
the Mafia and the government?

08:03.066 --> 08:05.068
♪ Call me irresponsible ♪

08:05.068 --> 08:06.861
One of 'em is organized!

08:06.861 --> 08:08.697
- [laughter]
- See, Ray?

08:08.697 --> 08:10.198
You just gotta know
your audience!

08:10.198 --> 08:11.241
[tires screeching]

08:11.241 --> 08:13.284
[gunfire]

08:13.410 --> 08:15.203
- Shit!
- [brakes screeching]

08:16.413 --> 08:17.455
[groaning]

08:17.580 --> 08:19.457
♪ Do my foolish alibis ♪

08:19.582 --> 08:21.084
[groaning]

08:21.084 --> 08:22.836
- ♪ Bother you? ♪
- [tires screeching]

08:22.961 --> 08:24.295
[crashing]

08:24.421 --> 08:27.090
♪ Well, I'm not too clever ♪

08:27.090 --> 08:30.635
- [panting]
- ♪ I just adore you ♪

08:30.760 --> 08:32.303
Whoa! Hold up, Ervad!

08:32.429 --> 08:33.471
I got your Drops right here.

08:33.596 --> 08:35.640
[Ray] Oz, you fuckin' traitor!

08:36.683 --> 08:38.226
[Ervad and Ray groan]

08:38.226 --> 08:39.519
What the fuck?!

08:39.644 --> 08:40.979
[engine revving]

08:41.104 --> 08:42.564
[metal screeching]

08:42.564 --> 08:44.149
[gunfire]

08:44.274 --> 08:45.316
[gunfire ricocheting]

08:45.442 --> 08:48.820
♪ Call me irresponsible ♪

08:48.820 --> 08:52.657
- ♪ Yes, I'm unreliable ♪
- [panting]

08:52.782 --> 08:55.618
♪ But it's undeniably true ♪

08:55.618 --> 08:57.287
[gunfire resumes outside]

08:57.287 --> 08:59.164
[Oz grunting]

08:59.289 --> 09:02.000
- ♪ That I'm irresponsibly mad ♪
- [gunfire ricocheting]

09:02.125 --> 09:04.753
- ♪ For you ♪
- [men yelling outside]

09:05.712 --> 09:07.672
♪ Go on and call me... ♪

09:07.797 --> 09:08.590
Shit.

09:08.590 --> 09:10.342
[grunting] Shit.

09:12.510 --> 09:13.678
[tires screeching]

09:14.637 --> 09:16.056
[Oz] Castillo!

09:17.891 --> 09:18.892
[man groans]

09:18.892 --> 09:20.477
Castillo! Let's go!

09:20.477 --> 09:22.771
- [tires screeching]
- Let's go!

09:23.688 --> 09:24.814
Get in.

09:24.814 --> 09:28.443
♪ I admit I'm unreliable ♪

09:28.443 --> 09:32.447
♪ But it is undeniably true ♪

09:33.448 --> 09:36.409
[fading] ♪ That I'm
irresponsibly mad... ♪

09:36.409 --> 09:38.328
[Nick] We're just riding down
the fuckin' road

09:38.328 --> 09:40.914
and then the truck--
[imitates gunfire] gets lit up.

09:40.914 --> 09:43.667
First SUV crashes,
we hop out of the car,

09:43.667 --> 09:46.628
we're fucking shot.
I'm beating some fucking guy...

09:46.628 --> 09:48.630
I'm definitely dead without
this motherfucker.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.382
Castillo here is dead
if it wasn't for Oz.

09:50.507 --> 09:53.301
- And then we fucking lock up...
- [Oz yelling indistinctly]

09:53.301 --> 09:55.136
[Nick continues indistinctly]

09:55.136 --> 09:59.140
[Oz and Viti arguing
indistinctly]

09:59.140 --> 10:01.393
[Oz] What the fuck
was I supposed to do?

10:01.518 --> 10:03.061
They ambushed us 'cause
they think we're weak.

10:03.186 --> 10:04.521
I tried to tell ya--

10:04.521 --> 10:06.272
[Viti] We look weak
'cause you let 'em fuck us.

10:06.272 --> 10:07.691
[Oz] Hey, it was your route!

10:07.691 --> 10:09.484
We were sittin' ducks out there.

10:09.484 --> 10:11.152
If it weren't for me,
more men woulda died.

10:11.152 --> 10:12.862
Please. You didn't do shit
to protect our Drops.

10:12.862 --> 10:15.782
The Maronis walked away
with the whole goddamn stash.

10:15.907 --> 10:17.242
[Sofia] Is that all
you care about?

10:17.367 --> 10:19.911
The product? The money we lost?

10:21.746 --> 10:23.039
We can get more money, gentlemen.

10:23.039 --> 10:24.207
You're missing
the point here.

10:24.207 --> 10:25.834
They humiliated our Family.

10:25.834 --> 10:27.961
I mean, they took my brother,
and they shoved his body

10:27.961 --> 10:30.755
in the trunk of a car,
like he was a piece of trash.

10:30.880 --> 10:33.717
Look, Sofia, we all cared
for Alberto--

10:33.717 --> 10:35.593
[Sofia] Well, I doubt that,
Milos. I really do.

10:35.719 --> 10:37.220
Justice is what matters.

10:37.220 --> 10:40.765
And that is what my brother--
your nephew-- deserves.

10:41.599 --> 10:42.600
Hear, hear.

10:44.102 --> 10:46.604
Why aren't his killers
strung up across the city?

10:47.397 --> 10:49.899
When the time is right,
the Maronis'll pay.

10:49.899 --> 10:51.484
[Sofia] The Maronis.
Right, okay.

10:51.484 --> 10:53.486
Well, open your eyes.
They weren't working alone.

10:54.237 --> 10:55.655
How'd they know about our route?

10:55.780 --> 10:57.032
How'd they know about
the FEMA truck?

10:57.032 --> 10:59.200
They had someone on the inside,
helping them.

10:59.951 --> 11:01.619
Someone in our own Family.

11:01.745 --> 11:03.288
[Viti] How dare you
with this shit.

11:03.413 --> 11:05.749
You waltzin' in here
like you mean something.

11:05.749 --> 11:07.459
You don't call the shots
around here.

11:07.584 --> 11:08.960
[Luca] Johnny! Neither do you.

11:09.085 --> 11:11.338
And this is my niece
you're talking to.

11:12.297 --> 11:13.965
Show her some fucking respect.

11:14.674 --> 11:16.634
[Viti] Sorry, Luca.
You're right.

11:18.511 --> 11:19.721
Sofia...

11:21.598 --> 11:23.058
my apologies.

11:25.435 --> 11:26.770
Increase security
around the house

11:26.770 --> 11:28.146
and all our businesses.

11:28.271 --> 11:30.899
Put the word out.
If anybody outside the network

11:30.899 --> 11:32.525
is selling our Drops,

11:33.318 --> 11:34.569
they'll answer for it.

11:35.987 --> 11:37.322
Let's call it a night.

11:42.160 --> 11:43.995
You need anything from me, Boss?

11:44.120 --> 11:45.330
You've done enough.

11:50.335 --> 11:51.711
Sofia...

11:52.337 --> 11:53.505
Stay.

11:57.884 --> 11:59.010
[door closes]

12:00.887 --> 12:02.097
[cup clatters]

12:02.097 --> 12:06.017
You've always had a nose
for bullshit, Sofia.

12:06.851 --> 12:08.687
Your father knew that too.

12:08.812 --> 12:11.690
But if there's a rat,
we'll find him.

12:11.815 --> 12:13.692
But the when and the how,
that...

12:15.026 --> 12:16.361
that ain't up to you.

12:17.696 --> 12:19.739
The when and the how...

12:21.157 --> 12:22.242
That's your call.

12:23.410 --> 12:24.619
Because you're the Boss.

12:28.498 --> 12:30.208
I'm gonna let that one slide.

12:30.875 --> 12:32.293
Because you're grieving.

12:32.836 --> 12:33.962
We're all grieving.

12:34.671 --> 12:36.798
Your brother's funeral
is tomorrow.

12:36.798 --> 12:39.134
Just focus on
laying him to rest.

12:41.678 --> 12:43.638
I'll deal with
the Family business.

12:49.894 --> 12:51.771
- Sofia.
- What do you want, Oz?

12:52.355 --> 12:53.773
I know we've got
our differences.

12:53.773 --> 12:55.650
You made that pretty
fuckin' clear.

12:55.650 --> 12:57.902
But I'm willin' to look past
the pain you put me through,

12:58.028 --> 12:59.320
if you are.

12:59.320 --> 13:00.822
- Is that right?
- Yeah.

13:00.822 --> 13:02.574
Look, I'm on your side.

13:03.533 --> 13:05.035
I saved your boy
Castillo's life tonight,

13:05.035 --> 13:06.745
even after what he did to me.

13:07.370 --> 13:08.621
What're we runnin',
a marathon here?

13:08.621 --> 13:11.124
Listen, what you said
about an inside man.

13:11.124 --> 13:12.709
I believe you.
I could ask around.

13:12.709 --> 13:14.377
Do some digging.
Whatever you need.

13:14.377 --> 13:16.004
Why would you do that?

13:16.546 --> 13:19.424
Because it should be you
in there, callin' the shots.

13:19.549 --> 13:21.426
You should be the new boss,
not Carmine's little brother.

13:21.551 --> 13:23.136
- Careful--
-"Careful" whatever.

13:23.261 --> 13:24.596
I know I shouldn't say it.
So what?

13:25.388 --> 13:27.474
Al is dead. I loved him, too.

13:27.974 --> 13:29.267
More than those pricks.

13:29.392 --> 13:30.268
And look...

13:30.894 --> 13:32.145
If one of 'em had a hand in it,

13:32.270 --> 13:33.688
who's to say you ain't next?

13:33.688 --> 13:35.273
They didn't care about Al.

13:35.398 --> 13:36.733
They sure as shit
don't like you.

13:36.733 --> 13:37.859
They think you're crazy.

13:37.859 --> 13:39.027
You don't need me
tellin' you that.

13:39.027 --> 13:40.111
You can feel it.

13:40.236 --> 13:41.905
But you got a card to play.

13:41.905 --> 13:45.033
Something that'll force them
to see the power you got.

13:45.617 --> 13:46.868
Al's shipment.

13:48.244 --> 13:49.454
The new drug.

13:51.122 --> 13:52.457
It's what he woulda wanted.

13:53.333 --> 13:54.626
To see you take over.

13:54.751 --> 13:56.795
Keep his dream alive, you know?

13:59.839 --> 14:02.801
You think you know
what's best for me, hmm?

14:03.802 --> 14:05.303
You think you know what I need?

14:06.346 --> 14:08.264
How are you any different
than those pricks in there?

14:08.264 --> 14:10.016
That ain't what
I was saying, Sofia--

14:10.141 --> 14:11.810
Very, very convenient

14:12.352 --> 14:14.646
that, all of a sudden,
you're on my side.

14:14.771 --> 14:15.939
Will you look at that?

14:15.939 --> 14:17.190
Right?

14:17.857 --> 14:18.858
My little helper.

14:18.983 --> 14:21.945
- Alright.
- Fucking desperate.

14:21.945 --> 14:24.656
You are scrambling for
whatever dignity you have left

14:24.781 --> 14:27.033
and you're hoping
I will save you.

14:27.659 --> 14:28.785
Not gonna happen.

14:29.369 --> 14:31.329
I don't owe you a fuckin' thing.

14:31.996 --> 14:33.248
No, you're right, you don't.

14:34.541 --> 14:35.667
I owe you.

14:43.800 --> 14:46.011
- [jazzy piano music playing]
- [Oz] Fuck 'em all.

14:46.136 --> 14:47.429
Trying to push me out?

14:48.179 --> 14:50.098
I was Carmine Falcone's
right hand.

14:50.098 --> 14:51.391
You'd think it'd mean something.

14:51.391 --> 14:53.852
A couple of "thank-yous"
wouldn't hurt, but no.

14:54.686 --> 14:56.229
"You've done enough, Oz."

14:56.229 --> 14:57.939
You think I've done enough, asshole?

14:57.939 --> 14:59.482
You ain't seen what I can do.

14:59.482 --> 15:00.942
[car horns honking]

15:00.942 --> 15:03.445
None of those fucks had
the balls to do what I did.

15:06.906 --> 15:08.450
Hey, kid! Let's go!

15:10.368 --> 15:12.328
A lotta people'd be happy
if their dipshit brother

15:12.328 --> 15:13.538
- turned up dead.
- [door closes]

15:13.663 --> 15:14.873
Maybe even ecstatic.

15:15.540 --> 15:16.916
Not Sofia Falcone!

15:17.542 --> 15:19.210
So friggin' uptight.

15:20.211 --> 15:21.254
[glasses clinking]

15:21.254 --> 15:22.547
She ain't gonna stop

15:22.672 --> 15:24.215
until she's got someone's
head on a platter.

15:24.341 --> 15:25.592
- [cork pops]
- Yeah. R-right.

15:25.592 --> 15:27.510
So, what's the plan with that,
by the way?

15:27.510 --> 15:29.179
- Are we gonna--
- I know what you're thinkin'.

15:29.179 --> 15:30.513
We can't kill her.

15:30.513 --> 15:32.223
Oh, um... No, I wasn't--

15:32.349 --> 15:34.893
She wants an inside man,
I'm gonna give her one.

15:35.894 --> 15:38.104
Otherwise, I ain't got no shot

15:38.104 --> 15:39.898
at getting my hands
on Al's shipment, you know?

15:41.733 --> 15:43.818
Jesus, Vic! I said no cilantro!

15:43.818 --> 15:45.820
- It's fuckin' everywhere!
- Shit, I'm sorry.

15:45.820 --> 15:48.573
Might as well shove a bar
of goddamn soap in my mouth.

15:48.698 --> 15:50.950
Girls are on their way.
Start pickin'.

15:52.786 --> 15:54.954
[engine revving]

15:57.082 --> 15:58.750
[man on radio]
Since the seawall's collapse,

15:58.875 --> 16:00.752
crime has spiked
all over Gotham.

16:00.877 --> 16:03.421
Going up by a whopping 42%.

16:03.546 --> 16:05.548
[woman] Don't forget
the rolling power outages.

16:05.548 --> 16:07.509
This city and the system
are broken.

16:07.509 --> 16:08.843
[man] And I doubt
the mayor-elect

16:08.843 --> 16:10.220
has the guts to fix it.

16:10.220 --> 16:11.763
They're letting psychos
out of Arkham now.

16:11.888 --> 16:13.431
- You hear about this?
- [woman] The Hangman.

16:13.556 --> 16:15.266
She was technically
exonerated.

16:15.392 --> 16:17.227
- [man] I don't care.
- Wait. Leave it on.

16:17.227 --> 16:18.937
Sofia Falcone
is a serial killer.

16:19.062 --> 16:21.398
Seven women. And that's just
who we know about.

16:21.398 --> 16:22.607
[car horns honking]

16:26.945 --> 16:28.571
[Oz] You ever heard of
the Blue Heron?

16:28.571 --> 16:30.365
- No.
- [Oz] It was a club.

16:31.366 --> 16:33.827
You know, it was the Falcone
hangout back in the day,

16:33.952 --> 16:35.161
and I was a bar-back.

16:35.161 --> 16:37.497
One day, this guy Pinchy
rolls in,

16:37.497 --> 16:38.998
says he's so impressed
with the way

16:39.124 --> 16:41.042
that I been takin' care
of everybody,

16:41.042 --> 16:42.502
he wants me to be his driver.

16:42.502 --> 16:45.130
Only problem was...
I couldn't drive.

16:45.255 --> 16:46.840
Right, so... so what'd you do?

16:47.298 --> 16:48.508
What'd I do?

16:50.135 --> 16:52.554
I took the goddamn job, kid.
What do you think?

16:52.554 --> 16:55.473
And this was on a Friday,
and I start on Monday.

16:55.598 --> 16:57.100
[chuckles]

16:57.100 --> 17:00.603
So, over the weekend,
I stole myself an old Buick.

17:00.603 --> 17:03.023
I drove it around
the Eastside like a maniac

17:03.148 --> 17:05.608
till I landed it in a ditch
next to the Sprang River.

17:05.608 --> 17:08.361
- But I fuckin' learned, Vic.
- [buzzer sounds]

17:08.486 --> 17:11.990
And on Monday, I became
Pinchy Rovegno's driver.

17:13.116 --> 17:14.534
- [buzzer sounds]
- [Victor] Where is he now?

17:14.659 --> 17:16.536
- Who?
- The, uh...

17:17.996 --> 17:20.999
Pinchy. What, uh...
What happened to him?

17:21.124 --> 17:22.584
[Oz] Ah, well.

17:22.584 --> 17:26.212
A few months later, Carmine
caught him talkin' to the Feds.

17:27.297 --> 17:28.548
Yeah, so Pinchy got popped.

17:28.673 --> 17:30.550
But Carmine saw somethin' in me.

17:30.550 --> 17:32.135
Thought I was worth
keepin' around.

17:32.135 --> 17:33.636
[knocking on door]

17:33.636 --> 17:35.180
And the rest is history.

17:37.182 --> 17:38.892
- [door opens]
- [Oz] Welcome, ladies.

17:38.892 --> 17:41.269
I'm glad you could make it.
Hey, Alice.

17:41.269 --> 17:43.730
Whoa, is that a new coat?
Very furry.

17:43.855 --> 17:45.732
- Hi, baby.
- Hey, Cin, Rox.

17:45.857 --> 17:47.525
- Hello.
- Everybody, this is Vic.

17:47.650 --> 17:49.819
Vic, everybody. There's my girl.

17:49.819 --> 17:50.945
- Hey.
- You alright?

17:50.945 --> 17:53.198
Yeah, yeah. Long day, tough day.

17:53.323 --> 17:54.866
- It's good you're here.
- Yeah?

17:54.991 --> 17:56.368
Let's put on some tunes.

17:56.493 --> 17:59.120
I'm asking
how much you got left.

17:59.120 --> 18:01.039
- And I told you. Nothing.
- [rock music playing]

18:01.706 --> 18:03.208
It's a goddamn drought
out there.

18:03.333 --> 18:04.709
Bullshit. Bullshit.

18:05.835 --> 18:06.920
You owe me, man.

18:09.339 --> 18:10.590
Take it up with The Riddler.

18:10.715 --> 18:13.385
[patrons chattering]

18:26.606 --> 18:28.733
Rough night, Detective?

18:30.944 --> 18:33.238
You gotta be kidding me.
I-I-I...

18:33.363 --> 18:34.489
[chuckles]

18:36.616 --> 18:40.787
No. I-I'm sorry,
but, um, all respect, no.

18:40.912 --> 18:42.080
No, no.

18:45.125 --> 18:47.210
[Sofia] You used to work
for my father.

18:47.210 --> 18:49.546
Half the force worked for
your father, you know.

18:49.546 --> 18:52.549
But you were particularly...
dependable,

18:52.549 --> 18:54.509
especially at finding
snakes in the grass.

18:55.552 --> 18:58.263
Right... until you became
a Drophead.

18:58.888 --> 19:00.306
Well, that's insulting.

19:00.306 --> 19:01.641
I don't think we need to--

19:02.809 --> 19:05.103
[Sofia] A gift,
for your condition.

19:07.105 --> 19:08.440
You wanna do 'em now?

19:09.315 --> 19:10.650
You can do 'em now.

19:14.779 --> 19:15.613
[squirting]

19:15.739 --> 19:16.823
[softly] Oh yeah.

19:16.948 --> 19:18.033
[grunts]

19:18.742 --> 19:19.951
[laughs, sniffs]

19:21.161 --> 19:23.329
Four hours ago, the Maronis

19:23.329 --> 19:26.624
hijacked a Falcone transport
heading for Robbinsville.

19:27.500 --> 19:30.211
I need to know how they came
to have that information.

19:30.211 --> 19:33.131
And you're coming to me,
instead of your Family? Why?

19:34.841 --> 19:36.968
Oh, you-you think it was
an inside job.

19:37.927 --> 19:41.181
That's something I don't know
if I'd feel comfortable...

19:42.974 --> 19:43.892
[murmurs]

19:46.436 --> 19:47.937
I'll need discretion.

19:47.937 --> 19:50.106
Let me see what I can dig up.

19:50.106 --> 19:51.191
Great.

19:51.191 --> 19:53.902
[laughing and exclaiming]

19:53.902 --> 19:56.237
- [Oz] Hey, everybody. Tonight...
- [phone chimes]

19:56.988 --> 19:59.824
Tonight went fuckin' sideways.
No easy way to say it.

19:59.949 --> 20:02.035
The Maronis came at us,
but we held our own.

20:02.619 --> 20:04.662
We spilled their goddamn blood
in the streets, too. Right?

20:04.788 --> 20:05.955
[men exclaim in agreement]

20:05.955 --> 20:07.749
[Oz] Okay, so I say
we save our anger.

20:07.749 --> 20:10.001
We keep it right in here,

20:10.126 --> 20:12.295
'cause the Maronis started
something they don't know what.

20:12.295 --> 20:14.005
- They'll fuckin' see.
- That's fuckin' right.

20:14.130 --> 20:16.841
So here's to our friends
who ain't so lucky tonight.

20:19.678 --> 20:20.845
Rest well.

20:22.514 --> 20:25.517
Hey, Vic, get over here. Rox...

20:26.643 --> 20:28.645
This is the guy who
fucked up the taco order.

20:28.645 --> 20:29.979
- Ah...
- Vic.

20:29.979 --> 20:31.898
Roxy here is a successful
entrepreneur

20:32.023 --> 20:33.775
in the, uh, camming industry.

20:33.775 --> 20:36.319
Wow, okay. So you're a camgirl.

20:36.319 --> 20:38.905
Whoa, easy, Romeo,
you can't afford her.

20:39.030 --> 20:40.532
I do mostly fetish stuff.

20:41.032 --> 20:42.033
Domination.

20:42.867 --> 20:44.119
Sometimes I work with cake.

20:44.119 --> 20:46.705
- You got a sweet tooth, Vic?
- [chuckles]

20:46.830 --> 20:49.082
[Oz laughs]
Gonna leave you to it.

20:49.082 --> 20:50.166
[Victor] All right.

20:50.166 --> 20:52.961
[indistinct chatter]

20:53.545 --> 20:56.006
[door clicking shut]

20:56.006 --> 20:57.298
[door closes]

21:00.427 --> 21:02.012
Where are you from?

21:02.012 --> 21:04.556
Yeah, I'm, um...
[stammers] I'm-I'm from...

21:04.681 --> 21:08.059
I'm... f-f-from Cr...

21:08.184 --> 21:10.020
[stutters softly]

21:10.020 --> 21:12.272
Crown Point.
I'm from Crown Point.

21:12.272 --> 21:13.857
Yeah, my cousin lived
over there.

21:13.857 --> 21:16.484
She said it's like a
no-man's-land now or something.

21:17.068 --> 21:19.821
I mean, they lost everything.

21:20.864 --> 21:22.157
What about you?

21:24.451 --> 21:25.660
Uh...

21:28.580 --> 21:30.165
- Um...
- So...

21:31.458 --> 21:32.709
How do you know Oz?

21:32.709 --> 21:33.752
Hm.

21:34.627 --> 21:36.046
Um, uh...

21:36.046 --> 21:37.839
I-I... I work for him.

21:38.882 --> 21:39.841
Really?

21:39.841 --> 21:41.092
Yeah, I'm...

21:41.718 --> 21:42.844
I'm his driver.

21:42.844 --> 21:43.928
Yeah.

21:44.763 --> 21:45.680
Huh.

21:48.224 --> 21:50.268
[rock music playing
in background]

21:56.441 --> 21:57.442
[knock at door]

22:04.449 --> 22:05.492
Yeah?

22:11.164 --> 22:12.457
Baby, can we talk?

22:12.582 --> 22:14.084
[Oz] It's gonna
have to wait, doll.

22:14.084 --> 22:15.960
Got a lot of shit
I'm dealing with.

22:18.630 --> 22:20.507
You killed Alberto Falcone.

22:20.965 --> 22:23.468
That's why you needed my alibi,
isn't it?

22:24.469 --> 22:25.637
[laughs]

22:27.180 --> 22:29.349
You're putting me
and my girls at risk.

22:31.017 --> 22:32.644
That's not part of the deal.

22:34.270 --> 22:35.772
Say something.

22:35.772 --> 22:37.232
Eve, sweetheart,

22:37.232 --> 22:38.650
there's all kinds of things
I can say,

22:38.775 --> 22:40.902
but what matters is,
ain't nothin' to be afraid of.

22:41.444 --> 22:44.072
Look, I got a file
on Johnny Viti.

22:44.072 --> 22:45.782
Once Luca gets his eyes on that,

22:45.782 --> 22:47.617
that prick weasel Viti's
gonna take the fall

22:47.617 --> 22:49.869
for the whole fuckin' thing.

22:49.994 --> 22:51.788
The Falcone underboss?

22:51.788 --> 22:53.206
He's untouchable.

22:53.206 --> 22:54.541
[Oz laughs]
No one's untouchable.

22:54.666 --> 22:55.875
Then neither are you.

23:02.716 --> 23:03.925
[Oz sighs]

23:09.139 --> 23:10.348
Hey, look at me.

23:11.516 --> 23:13.018
- Look at me.
- [Eve sighs]

23:13.143 --> 23:14.519
You bet on the right horse.

23:15.562 --> 23:17.897
And I ain't gonna be on my own
enjoyin' the spoils.

23:18.648 --> 23:19.941
I'm gonna open up another club,

23:19.941 --> 23:22.068
it's gonna be swankier
than the Iceberg Lounge,

23:22.068 --> 23:23.695
your girls for entertainment.

23:24.362 --> 23:26.614
I slip these pics to Luca
at the funeral tomorrow

23:26.614 --> 23:28.491
and it's baby blue skies, doll.

23:28.491 --> 23:29.868
You just gotta trust me.

23:35.540 --> 23:36.708
[softly] Come here.

23:38.251 --> 23:39.753
[Oz grunts]

23:40.837 --> 23:42.088
There she is.

23:42.881 --> 23:45.383
You're playing a dangerous game
with this Family, Oz.

23:45.508 --> 23:46.843
Oh, yeah?

23:46.843 --> 23:49.804
You think I want Sofia Falcone
knocking on my door?

23:51.348 --> 23:53.725
Women like me, we got enough
targets on our backs.

23:53.850 --> 23:56.728
And I'm tellin' you,
I know what I'm doin'.

23:58.021 --> 23:59.564
You seen me through worse,

24:00.565 --> 24:02.442
and I always come out
the other side,

24:03.360 --> 24:04.611
better than before.

24:06.112 --> 24:07.238
Trust me.

24:09.282 --> 24:11.910
There ain't nothin' about
Sofia Falcone I can't handle.

24:17.582 --> 24:18.667
[sharp gasp]

24:19.209 --> 24:20.377
[wheezing]

24:20.377 --> 24:23.922
[panting]

24:26.049 --> 24:27.133
[softly] Fuck.

24:27.133 --> 24:29.302
[uneasy music playing]

24:35.225 --> 24:36.267
[exhales]

24:56.246 --> 24:57.706
[music fades]

24:57.706 --> 24:59.833
[traffic hums outside]

25:02.168 --> 25:04.838
Uh... I appreciate the gesture,

25:04.963 --> 25:06.548
but this is too much.

25:06.548 --> 25:09.300
- Ah, come on, doll. You--
- [phone buzzes]

25:10.802 --> 25:11.636
Yeah?

25:13.263 --> 25:14.639
I'll be right there.

25:15.932 --> 25:17.475
[tense music playing]

25:18.268 --> 25:19.436
Everything okay?

25:19.436 --> 25:21.146
Yeah, yeah, just work.

25:30.989 --> 25:32.532
[brakes squealing]

25:33.366 --> 25:35.035
[man speaking indistinctly]

25:35.035 --> 25:36.494
[door opens]

25:39.998 --> 25:41.541
[Oz] Hey, Ma.

25:41.666 --> 25:42.500
[door closes]

25:42.625 --> 25:43.960
- You alright?
- Yeah, I'm fine.

25:43.960 --> 25:45.712
I just went for a walk.

25:46.212 --> 25:47.839
- [Oz] Okay.
- This guy.

25:47.964 --> 25:50.300
This guy.
He's got nothin' better to do

25:50.300 --> 25:52.469
than waste your goddamn time.

25:52.469 --> 25:53.845
Come here.

25:59.225 --> 26:00.185
Qué pasó?

26:00.852 --> 26:01.853
[Francis] Hey.

26:03.521 --> 26:04.898
You're a nurse, right?

26:07.317 --> 26:08.485
Do you need anything?

26:08.485 --> 26:10.528
Why does everybody
keep asking me that?

26:14.699 --> 26:17.410
[in Spanish]

26:35.887 --> 26:37.722
[in English] Oh, so you're
a doctor now, too?

26:37.847 --> 26:39.766
I don't pay you for your
medical advice, Cesar.

26:41.393 --> 26:42.394
Jesus.

26:47.857 --> 26:49.109
[in Spanish]

26:49.776 --> 26:50.985
[in English] Alright?

26:50.985 --> 26:52.404
[speaks Spanish]

26:53.071 --> 26:54.906
[sniffs] Vic, show him out.

27:01.621 --> 27:02.706
God bless you.

27:02.706 --> 27:04.165
Thanks a lot.

27:07.877 --> 27:08.837
[in Spanish]

27:41.119 --> 27:44.330
["Tears and Laughter"
by Dinah Washington playing]

27:53.965 --> 27:56.509
♪ Tears and laughter ♪

27:58.636 --> 28:01.973
- ♪ Love forever after ♪
- Come on.

28:04.309 --> 28:07.479
♪ Tears, tears, tears ♪

28:08.688 --> 28:10.857
- [breathes shakily]
- ♪ Tears and laughter ♪

28:10.982 --> 28:12.942
♪ I'll share with you ♪

28:14.027 --> 28:16.237
[Francis shudders]
You gotta help me up.

28:16.237 --> 28:18.907
- ♪ Rain and rainbows ♪
- All right. Good.

28:20.700 --> 28:23.161
- ♪ Love will make rainbows ♪
- [snapping fingers]

28:23.286 --> 28:25.163
- There you go.
- [Francis chuckles]

28:25.747 --> 28:28.625
♪ Rain, rain, rain ♪

28:28.625 --> 28:29.834
[Francis sighs]

28:29.959 --> 28:31.753
♪ Rain and rainbows... ♪

28:32.837 --> 28:34.547
You promised me, Oswald.

28:35.799 --> 28:37.509
I deserve a better life.

28:38.301 --> 28:41.221
I don't wanna be cooped up
in this shitty house no more.

28:41.221 --> 28:42.889
I know, Ma. I know.

28:43.556 --> 28:45.141
I won't be here forever.

28:45.141 --> 28:46.393
None of us will.

28:46.393 --> 28:48.061
You know, but we got time.

28:48.061 --> 28:49.396
You just gotta be patient.

28:49.396 --> 28:51.314
Yeah, tell it to my headstone.

28:51.314 --> 28:53.608
Jesus.
Don't start with that shit.

28:54.526 --> 28:56.361
Alright. I'm workin' on it.

28:58.113 --> 29:01.449
♪ Tears and laughter... ♪

29:02.867 --> 29:05.578
If my son is a nothing,
what am I?

29:11.418 --> 29:14.129
Oz. Um, the, um...

29:14.921 --> 29:16.756
the funeral's starting.

29:18.591 --> 29:20.760
Go. Go, go, go. You go.

29:20.760 --> 29:22.053
- You sure?
- Yeah.

29:23.096 --> 29:24.389
Get outta here.

29:31.062 --> 29:32.063
Oswald...

29:33.231 --> 29:34.607
Yeah, I know, Ma.

29:35.567 --> 29:36.818
I won't let you down.

29:38.403 --> 29:39.654
[distant dog barking]

29:40.697 --> 29:42.240
- [song ends]
- [engine revving]

29:51.958 --> 29:54.252
[distant clamoring]

29:56.129 --> 29:57.255
[Oz] Come on!

29:57.964 --> 29:58.965
[horn honks]

30:02.385 --> 30:04.012
[protestors chanting]
Send her back!

30:04.012 --> 30:07.140
- Send her back! Send her back!
- [man 1] Hang the Hangman!

30:07.265 --> 30:09.184
Send her back! Send her back!

30:09.184 --> 30:10.685
[man 2] Falcones are fascists!

30:10.685 --> 30:13.063
Hey, Luca. I got something
you're gonna wanna--

30:13.063 --> 30:15.106
- [driver] Mr. Falcone.
- Thanks.

30:16.441 --> 30:17.400
Prick.

30:17.400 --> 30:20.236
[protestors clamoring]

30:20.236 --> 30:22.989
[man shouting indistinctly]

30:26.618 --> 30:29.662
[protestors chanting
indistinctly]

30:32.290 --> 30:35.210
[protestors] Send her back!
Send her back!

30:35.210 --> 30:37.796
Send her back! Send her back!

30:37.921 --> 30:41.341
[bell tolling]

30:49.140 --> 30:50.392
Not a fan of crowds?

30:52.435 --> 30:54.813
Just needed a minute away
from the spectacle.

30:56.147 --> 30:57.565
[Oz] Lotta ass-kissin' going on.

30:57.565 --> 30:59.150
Real nice service though.

31:00.360 --> 31:01.861
Didn't see you in there.

31:03.113 --> 31:04.572
I didn't know you were lookin'.

31:05.365 --> 31:06.366
[chuckles]

31:06.491 --> 31:07.659
I was in the back.

31:08.827 --> 31:11.746
[sighs] Thinkin' about how much
Al woulda hated it.

31:12.664 --> 31:13.998
Yeah, he would've left early.

31:14.874 --> 31:16.376
Found a better party.

31:16.501 --> 31:18.086
[laughs] Yeah.

31:18.712 --> 31:21.047
[birds chirping]

31:27.554 --> 31:30.015
We didn't have a service
for my brothers.

31:32.142 --> 31:34.227
My ma said she didn't want
to deal with the pity.

31:35.395 --> 31:37.147
Well, my ma, she, uh...

31:37.147 --> 31:38.440
she wouldn't get outta bed.

31:39.232 --> 31:40.358
For weeks.

31:41.693 --> 31:42.777
Maybe a month.

31:43.903 --> 31:46.197
I tried all kinds of shit
to get her up and goin' but...

31:47.866 --> 31:49.200
you know, nothin' took.

31:51.536 --> 31:53.830
Then one night, outta the blue,
she came to me,

31:53.830 --> 31:55.457
she was all dolled up.

31:57.000 --> 32:00.045
"Oswald, we're going out,"
she says.

32:00.170 --> 32:01.379
I was fuckin' thrilled.

32:03.006 --> 32:04.966
She took me to a jazz club
in the Eastside.

32:05.550 --> 32:06.634
Monroe's.

32:07.552 --> 32:10.555
Yeah, it's the first time
I ever heard live music.

32:10.680 --> 32:11.598
Whoa!

32:13.183 --> 32:14.559
We danced all night.

32:16.353 --> 32:17.395
You and your mom?

32:18.021 --> 32:19.356
That's what we did.

32:19.356 --> 32:21.107
How we celebrated 'em, you know.

32:21.107 --> 32:22.108
Jack and Benny.

32:23.109 --> 32:25.403
They woulda fuckin'
loved it, too. [chuckles]

32:25.528 --> 32:28.031
Anyway, after that,
she started gettin' outta bed.

32:28.031 --> 32:30.075
She went back to work.
She took care of me.

32:32.202 --> 32:34.412
What do you think it was
that changed for her?

32:35.080 --> 32:37.916
Uh, I'd like to think it was me,
but I dunno.

32:39.209 --> 32:41.294
She died a few years back.
I never asked.

32:43.213 --> 32:46.466
Shit like this, the pain of it,
you gotta be careful,

32:47.133 --> 32:49.260
'cause it'll eat you alive
if you let it.

32:51.930 --> 32:53.890
It's helluva lot more fun
to dance.

32:53.890 --> 32:55.975
[approaching footsteps]

32:59.479 --> 33:00.438
[Castillo] Ms. Falcone.

33:02.065 --> 33:03.483
There's a call for you.

33:03.608 --> 33:05.110
[Oz clears his throat]

33:05.235 --> 33:06.653
We should get to the house.

33:08.613 --> 33:09.948
[shoe scraping]

33:11.074 --> 33:12.784
Listen, what I said before,

33:14.160 --> 33:15.036
I meant.

33:16.496 --> 33:17.664
Excuse me.

33:20.959 --> 33:22.377
[somber music playing]

33:22.377 --> 33:24.462
[whispers] The detective says
he's got something.

33:25.463 --> 33:28.466
[phone buzzing]

33:29.634 --> 33:31.302
[receding footsteps]

33:36.808 --> 33:39.060
[dramatic music playing]

33:43.857 --> 33:45.025
[door opens]

33:45.650 --> 33:48.862
No, no. Wait, wait.
Oh, oh. Right there.

33:52.115 --> 33:53.908
Ta-da. [wheezing chuckle]

33:55.201 --> 33:56.828
Alright. This is Ervad.

33:56.953 --> 33:59.080
He's one of the Maronis
who lifted your Drops.

33:59.080 --> 34:02.042
He will perk up
once the morphine wears off.

34:02.167 --> 34:03.918
What are we supposed to do
with him?

34:03.918 --> 34:05.337
It's my brother's memorial.

34:05.462 --> 34:07.839
You said you wanted answers,
I brought you answers.

34:08.798 --> 34:09.924
In the flesh.

34:09.924 --> 34:11.468
[car engine revs nearby]

34:11.468 --> 34:14.054
You better hurry up,
'cause he ain't gonna last long.

34:22.479 --> 34:24.189
Take him to the basement.
Quietly.

34:24.856 --> 34:27.025
When he wakes up, find me.

34:30.195 --> 34:31.654
[Nadia] You inflated
your position.

34:31.654 --> 34:34.074
Said you had the inside track
with Luca.

34:34.657 --> 34:36.242
But now, the Falcones snatched

34:36.242 --> 34:38.036
one of our men
out of the hospital.

34:38.161 --> 34:40.246
And you didn't say
a motherfuckin' word.

34:40.246 --> 34:42.290
- W-We shoulda been warned.
- [Nadia] Taj.

34:42.290 --> 34:43.792
[in Farsi]

34:46.336 --> 34:47.712
[in English] This ain't Luca.

34:48.713 --> 34:51.257
Trust me. He don't tie his shoes
without lookin' both ways.

34:52.258 --> 34:54.594
It's gotta be Sofia Falcone,
acting on her own.

34:55.261 --> 34:57.097
Chick just got out of Arkham,
so she's a little...

34:57.222 --> 34:58.640
A Falcone is a Falcone.

34:59.432 --> 35:01.685
You should know
all their movements.

35:01.685 --> 35:03.395
Otherwise you have
no value to us.

35:04.187 --> 35:05.480
You broke your word.

35:05.480 --> 35:08.441
And that is not something
our Family tolerates.

35:08.441 --> 35:10.652
It is how we have survived
this long.

35:11.236 --> 35:13.530
Whoa, hey, hey, hey! Hey, hey!

35:14.072 --> 35:15.281
Goddammit, just listen.

35:18.743 --> 35:20.578
My pocket. My fuckin' pocket.

35:21.913 --> 35:23.498
My jacket pocket!

35:24.457 --> 35:25.750
Let's see what he has.

35:25.875 --> 35:27.919
[tense music playing]

35:34.384 --> 35:35.760
What am I looking at?

35:36.594 --> 35:39.848
Johnny Viti is fuckin'
Luca Falcone's wife.

35:39.848 --> 35:41.141
They been doin' it for years.

35:41.266 --> 35:42.517
You're lookin' at the proof.

35:43.309 --> 35:45.937
That's just the cherry on top.
I got all kinds of dirt.

35:46.771 --> 35:47.939
Lots of it.

35:48.773 --> 35:50.650
We can squeeze 'em one by one.

35:52.110 --> 35:54.404
We want our man back.

35:54.404 --> 35:55.488
Yeah, of course.

35:56.072 --> 35:56.990
Me too.

35:57.824 --> 35:59.617
Gimme his name. I'll find him.

36:00.243 --> 36:01.578
Ervad Hakimi.

36:01.578 --> 36:03.204
You met him at Blackgate.

36:03.913 --> 36:04.914
And I suggest you hurry,

36:04.914 --> 36:07.542
'cause if the Falcones
get him to talk,

36:07.542 --> 36:09.586
he'll have a lot to say
about you.

36:09.586 --> 36:11.504
[dramatic music playing]

36:13.340 --> 36:15.550
- [music fades]
- [indistinct chatter]

36:25.352 --> 36:28.146
[chatter quiets]

36:29.272 --> 36:30.815
[guests whispering]

36:35.945 --> 36:37.989
[woman whispers]
I can't believe she's out.

36:39.491 --> 36:41.659
[ice clinking]

36:45.872 --> 36:47.624
[indistinct whispering]

36:47.624 --> 36:49.084
[woman whispers] This is crazy.

36:49.876 --> 36:52.212
[man whispers]
She's become unhinged.

36:52.212 --> 36:54.005
[woman shushing]

36:55.840 --> 36:58.051
[woman whispers]
She's fucking crazy.

36:58.176 --> 36:59.344
[silverware clatters]

37:00.637 --> 37:02.180
[hushed gasps]

37:03.723 --> 37:05.517
[indistinct whispering]

37:06.017 --> 37:08.436
[somber music playing]

37:09.020 --> 37:11.314
[Oz] It's gotta be Sofia
running her own game.

37:11.314 --> 37:13.775
We could be drivin'
to our deaths right now.

37:13.775 --> 37:15.443
Sh-Should we turn around?

37:15.443 --> 37:17.445
The only way outta this
is through, kid.

37:17.445 --> 37:20.323
Nadia took the pictures,
but Viti's still our mark.

37:20.323 --> 37:21.741
Red Mercedes, okay?

37:21.741 --> 37:23.660
That's the car
you're lookin' for.

37:23.660 --> 37:25.954
- Yeah, I don't--
- And just so we're clear,

37:25.954 --> 37:27.664
you're gonna plant the jewels
in Viti's car

37:27.664 --> 37:29.040
while I find Ervad.

37:29.666 --> 37:32.127
All these people, there's only a
couple spots they can keep him.

37:32.127 --> 37:34.921
Yeah, Oz, look,
I-I-I want to help,

37:35.046 --> 37:37.340
I-I just got a-a...
a couple of questions--

37:37.340 --> 37:39.134
Hey, hey, hey.
Look at me. Look at me.

37:39.134 --> 37:41.553
We pull this off,
Viti takes the fall,

37:41.678 --> 37:43.096
we're one step closer
to the top.

37:43.221 --> 37:45.390
We're not just gonna walk away
outta fear. Right, chief?

37:46.683 --> 37:48.476
- That's right.
- Fuck yeah, right.

37:49.602 --> 37:51.730
You feel alive, Vic? Huh?
[laughs]

37:51.855 --> 37:54.232
- Feel your heart beating?
- [Victor] Mm-hmm.

37:54.357 --> 37:56.401
Good. Good.
Let's keep it that way, huh?

37:57.736 --> 37:59.988
[suspenseful music playing]

38:13.460 --> 38:15.128
[line ringing]

38:15.253 --> 38:16.338
What's he saying?

38:16.338 --> 38:17.922
[Castillo]
Ervad's still out cold.

38:21.384 --> 38:23.178
[Luca] Thanks for coming.

38:23.178 --> 38:24.804
Good to see you.

38:25.889 --> 38:27.599
[Luca continues indistinctly]

38:30.435 --> 38:31.811
[Castillo]
He doesn't look too good.

38:31.811 --> 38:33.897
- I got my eye on him.
- [Sofia] Well, get him up.

38:33.897 --> 38:35.982
I need to know
who killed my brother.

38:36.107 --> 38:37.609
[Castillo] Of course,
Ms. Falcone.

38:49.579 --> 38:51.456
[indistinct chatter]

38:54.793 --> 38:56.336
That's alright. Keep talkin'.
I already know.

38:56.336 --> 38:58.171
- Oz.
- [Milos] Already know what?

38:58.171 --> 38:59.673
Don't bullshit me, Milos.

38:59.673 --> 39:01.675
I lost good men and nearly got
my own head shot off.

39:01.675 --> 39:03.968
You should've told me you had
one of those scumbags here.

39:04.094 --> 39:05.220
What?

39:05.220 --> 39:06.179
Really, Johnny?

39:06.304 --> 39:07.806
Who ya got in the basement?

39:08.348 --> 39:09.724
I been in this Family years,

39:09.724 --> 39:11.685
you're gonna trust one of
Sofia's guys over me?

39:11.810 --> 39:13.395
It's bullshit. Bullshit.

39:17.649 --> 39:18.733
[quietly] Come on.

39:19.317 --> 39:21.152
[suspenseful music continues]

39:23.780 --> 39:25.824
[woman's voice]
Alberto, Sofia...

39:25.949 --> 39:27.325
[child's voice]
I'm gonna beat you!

39:27.450 --> 39:28.493
[woman] Come here.

39:30.161 --> 39:31.746
[sound of children's laughter]

39:31.746 --> 39:33.373
[emotional music playing]

39:33.373 --> 39:36.001
[children chattering in film]

39:38.670 --> 39:41.089
[woman] Look at me. Smile!

39:41.089 --> 39:42.590
[woman laughing]

39:42.590 --> 39:44.634
- [woman] Happy New Year!
- Happy New Year.

39:44.634 --> 39:46.469
- [cheering]
- Have a great year.

39:46.469 --> 39:47.470
It's gonna be the best.

39:47.470 --> 39:49.431
[noisemakers sounding in film]

40:01.860 --> 40:03.862
[woman 2] Sofia! Oh my God!

40:03.987 --> 40:05.405
[music fades]

40:05.530 --> 40:07.365
It's so nice to see you.

40:07.490 --> 40:09.242
You too, Carla.

40:10.535 --> 40:12.037
You look, uh, the same.

40:12.162 --> 40:14.873
I like your dress.
You always had such great style.

40:18.335 --> 40:21.254
Do you remember all those
wild nights at Lake Como?

40:21.379 --> 40:25.300
Getting drunk, hanging out
with those horny Italian boys?

40:25.300 --> 40:26.593
Yeah.

40:26.593 --> 40:28.553
Uh, we got into some
trouble for that.

40:28.678 --> 40:30.597
Yeah, but it was worth it.

40:30.597 --> 40:32.557
You know, I still go to Italy
every summer.

40:33.099 --> 40:34.642
We should plan a girls' trip.

40:35.352 --> 40:36.811
A-A girls' trip.

40:36.811 --> 40:39.689
Yeah, that-that could be... fun.

40:39.689 --> 40:41.024
- Um...
- [footsteps approach]

40:41.024 --> 40:42.150
[girl] Mama!

40:42.150 --> 40:44.152
They have cake. Can I have cake?

40:44.152 --> 40:45.070
Who's this?

40:45.195 --> 40:46.821
I'm Gia.

40:46.821 --> 40:49.866
Hi, Gia. I'm your mom's cousin.

40:50.408 --> 40:51.576
[Carla whispers] Gia.

40:53.078 --> 40:55.455
[soft, tense music playing]

41:00.710 --> 41:02.253
[Sofia] Aren't you pretty.

41:03.546 --> 41:06.800
Uh-oh, your barrette's loose.

41:06.925 --> 41:08.968
- Oh, I can fix that--
- I got it.

41:13.723 --> 41:15.183
There you go.

41:16.976 --> 41:18.895
She's a real cutie, Carla.

41:18.895 --> 41:20.313
[softly] Yeah...

41:20.438 --> 41:22.023
Make sure you keep her
protected.

41:22.774 --> 41:24.275
A young woman in this Family...

41:25.151 --> 41:26.611
Might not end well for her.

41:28.613 --> 41:29.572
[Carla] Come on.

41:29.572 --> 41:30.782
[Viti] Sofia.

41:33.743 --> 41:35.120
Luca wants to see you.

41:41.459 --> 41:43.378
[tense music playing]

41:45.088 --> 41:46.297
- [alarm beeps]
- [lock clicks]

41:50.635 --> 41:51.720
[footsteps approaching]

41:51.720 --> 41:53.054
The hell you doing?

41:53.054 --> 41:54.597
That's my boss's car!

41:54.597 --> 41:56.641
I-I-I work here.
The alarm was going off.

41:56.766 --> 41:58.143
Taking something outta the car?

41:59.144 --> 42:00.687
- What? No.
- What's in the bag?

42:00.812 --> 42:01.813
[man] Hey!

42:02.814 --> 42:03.898
Hey!

42:04.774 --> 42:06.568
[suspenseful music playing]

42:07.152 --> 42:08.486
It's un-fucking-believable.

42:08.987 --> 42:10.447
You and Sofia,
you really thought

42:10.447 --> 42:11.906
you could keep this
from the Family.

42:14.534 --> 42:16.327
[tense music playing]

42:22.959 --> 42:25.378
[door creaking]

42:37.390 --> 42:38.516
[music fades]

42:45.357 --> 42:46.399
Hey, Ervad.

42:50.195 --> 42:51.571
- Ervad.
- [Ervad groans]

42:51.696 --> 42:53.031
Wake up, pal.

42:53.156 --> 42:54.616
Hey, Nadia sent me.

42:55.325 --> 42:56.284
Can you hear me?

42:57.035 --> 42:59.037
Help... [choking]

42:59.162 --> 43:00.246
[hoarsely] Help me.

43:00.246 --> 43:01.915
Yeah, yeah.
That's what I'm here for.

43:02.374 --> 43:04.292
But I can't just walk you
outta here.

43:04.292 --> 43:06.044
You're gonna have to do
something for me first.

43:06.503 --> 43:08.630
There's this chick.
She's got an ax to grind.

43:08.630 --> 43:10.674
She's gonna roll in here,
she's gonna ask you

43:10.674 --> 43:12.759
if you been workin'
with someone on the inside.

43:13.760 --> 43:15.720
Hey, hey, hey, hey. Look at me.

43:16.388 --> 43:18.682
I need you to say the name
Johnny Viti.

43:18.682 --> 43:20.975
He killed Alberto Falcone.

43:20.975 --> 43:23.937
Listen to me. Johnny Viti.

43:24.729 --> 43:26.898
Alright?
That's the name you give 'em.

43:27.399 --> 43:29.234
Then I help you, alright?

43:29.359 --> 43:30.652
[weakly] Alright.

43:30.652 --> 43:33.822
- Johnny... Viti...
- [Oz] There it is.

43:33.822 --> 43:37.409
[phone buzzing]

43:38.201 --> 43:39.994
Vic. How we lookin'?

43:39.994 --> 43:42.497
Oz, I-I-I couldn't do it.

43:42.497 --> 43:44.791
I couldn't get the jewels
into Viti's car.

43:44.916 --> 43:46.334
The fuck you talkin' about?

43:46.334 --> 43:47.502
They're lookin' for me.

43:47.502 --> 43:50.255
Security, they s-s-s...

43:50.255 --> 43:52.674
[Oz] Where are you?
Where's the fuckin' jewels?

43:52.674 --> 43:54.843
I had to run, okay?
But I still got the pouch.

43:54.843 --> 43:56.386
I c-- I c-c--

43:56.386 --> 43:58.013
[Victor stuttering] I can't--

43:58.013 --> 43:59.597
God, tell me what to do!

44:03.268 --> 44:05.270
[Ervad] Oz, I can say it.

44:06.229 --> 44:07.480
I'll say his name.

44:08.314 --> 44:09.691
Viti...

44:12.277 --> 44:13.278
[grumbles]

44:13.987 --> 44:15.447
Plan's changed, pal.

44:16.156 --> 44:17.782
[suspenseful music playing]

44:18.825 --> 44:20.577
I gotta give 'em
somethin' solid,

44:20.577 --> 44:22.162
or they'll be lookin' at me.

44:23.246 --> 44:24.456
I can't have that.

44:28.752 --> 44:30.712
- [Oz shushing]
- [muffled choking]

44:30.712 --> 44:32.464
[blade slices]

44:33.506 --> 44:34.924
[muffled groaning]

44:34.924 --> 44:36.676
[suspenseful music builds]

44:41.097 --> 44:43.183
- [grunting]
- [flesh squelching]

44:43.308 --> 44:44.642
[groaning]

44:47.270 --> 44:48.396
[music fades]

44:52.317 --> 44:54.652
[breathing rapidly]

45:11.628 --> 45:12.671
[breathing rapidly]

45:17.384 --> 45:19.302
We all gotta make
sacrifices, pal.

45:19.302 --> 45:20.929
[suspenseful music playing]

45:32.190 --> 45:34.317
I told you to come to me.
Not go behind my back.

45:34.317 --> 45:36.277
Well, I did go to you
and you told me to weep

45:36.277 --> 45:37.987
about my dead brother
and do nothing.

45:37.987 --> 45:39.322
There is a traitor
in this Family,

45:39.322 --> 45:40.615
and I brought you someone

45:40.615 --> 45:41.908
who can give us
an actual fucking answer.

45:42.033 --> 45:43.451
[Luca] No one comes in.

45:50.542 --> 45:51.751
[Sofia inhales sharply]

45:51.751 --> 45:52.836
[Sofia] Fuck.

45:52.836 --> 45:54.254
[Luca] Jesus Christ.

45:56.006 --> 45:57.215
I warned you.

45:58.341 --> 46:01.261
You get me everyone
from the Drops transport.

46:01.386 --> 46:03.388
Nobody leaves.

46:08.226 --> 46:09.602
[door opens]

46:10.520 --> 46:11.438
[door closes]

46:12.772 --> 46:13.815
Oz.

46:13.815 --> 46:15.275
Hey, Dom. You seen Viti?

46:15.400 --> 46:16.234
Let's go.

46:16.359 --> 46:17.527
What are you doin'?

46:17.527 --> 46:19.571
[tense music playing]

46:21.239 --> 46:22.907
[Dom] Close the doors.

46:23.033 --> 46:24.325
[Oz] What's goin' on?

46:24.325 --> 46:26.036
- [door closes]
- [man 1] Get them inside.

46:26.036 --> 46:27.829
[man 2] Search everyone
for weapons.

46:32.876 --> 46:34.252
[Leo] We're looking for a knife.

46:34.377 --> 46:35.920
Nick, what the fuck is goin' on?

46:36.046 --> 46:37.964
Someone iced a Maroni
in the basement.

46:39.924 --> 46:42.969
[rapid breathing]

46:52.062 --> 46:55.023
[Viti grunting, struggling]
The fuck!

46:55.023 --> 46:57.442
- Come on!
- Fuck you!

46:58.151 --> 47:00.820
You touch me again, I will have
that goddamn hand cut off.

47:05.241 --> 47:06.368
The fuck you lookin' at?

47:06.368 --> 47:07.952
It was you, wasn't it?

47:08.453 --> 47:10.246
You sent us there
to get massacred.

47:10.246 --> 47:11.748
What the Maronis give ya, huh?

47:11.748 --> 47:13.333
Watch your mouth,
you fucking gimp.

47:13.333 --> 47:15.251
Fuck your mother, you dirty rat!

47:15.251 --> 47:16.753
- [Viti] Fuck you!
- Fuck your mother!

47:16.753 --> 47:18.630
[man] Hey, hey, hey, hey!

47:18.755 --> 47:20.715
[Oz] ...your face off,
you motherfucker!

47:20.715 --> 47:23.259
- Let him go! Let him go!
- [Luca] Hey!

47:23.259 --> 47:24.260
Get the fuck off me!

47:24.260 --> 47:26.346
Hey! Everybody back in line!

47:27.639 --> 47:29.724
One of you is a traitor.

47:31.935 --> 47:33.687
Feeding information
to the fuckin' enemy.

47:33.812 --> 47:34.854
That ends tonight.

47:34.854 --> 47:37.399
I will not tolerate a rat.

47:37.399 --> 47:38.692
- Fucking shit.
- [Dom] He's clean.

47:38.817 --> 47:41.194
[tense music playing]

47:43.613 --> 47:44.823
Got him.

47:44.948 --> 47:46.032
It was in his pocket.

47:46.157 --> 47:47.450
[Castillo] That's not mine.

47:47.450 --> 47:48.868
That's not f-- Get off of me.

47:48.868 --> 47:50.870
Ms. Falcone, I swear to God,
that is not mine.

47:51.955 --> 47:54.165
- It was you.
- That's not true.

47:54.290 --> 47:55.709
[Sofia] You were there
with him that night.

47:55.709 --> 47:58.253
- You killed him.
- I didn't. I would never!

47:58.253 --> 47:59.754
- Give me your gun.
- [Castillo] Sofia.

47:59.754 --> 48:01.756
- Give me your fucking gun.
- Please, listen to me.

48:01.756 --> 48:03.258
- I would never do that.
- Give me your gun.

48:03.842 --> 48:05.885
I have been nothing
but loyal to you!

48:05.885 --> 48:07.387
Give me your fucking gun!

48:07.512 --> 48:08.555
[gunshot]

48:09.681 --> 48:11.391
[bullet casing clatters]

48:16.521 --> 48:17.731
[clears throat]

48:24.320 --> 48:26.573
[Sofia] You should have
left him for me.

48:26.573 --> 48:29.075
- Sofia, it's done--
- He was mine to kill.

48:29.075 --> 48:31.286
- For Alberto.
- I made the call.

48:35.165 --> 48:36.249
[weary sigh]

48:38.251 --> 48:40.420
Maybe it's time for you
to leave Gotham.

48:41.087 --> 48:42.130
What?

48:42.130 --> 48:44.883
We got to do what's best...
for you.

48:45.842 --> 48:47.218
For your safety.

48:49.054 --> 48:51.973
Italy is beautiful
this time of year.

48:51.973 --> 48:53.767
[uneasy music playing]

48:53.767 --> 48:56.019
Didn't you spend your summers
there, in Lake Como?

48:56.019 --> 48:59.606
[clock ticking faintly]

49:04.235 --> 49:07.197
You're right, Uncle Luca...

49:07.322 --> 49:10.492
And I could use the time away.

49:10.492 --> 49:11.743
[Luca] Yeah.

49:12.452 --> 49:13.745
It'll be good for you.

49:14.954 --> 49:16.247
[laughs softly]

49:16.373 --> 49:18.083
Sweetheart. [kisses]

49:20.543 --> 49:21.586
Come in.

49:21.711 --> 49:22.837
We're done here.

49:36.768 --> 49:40.188
[clock ticking]

49:42.065 --> 49:43.525
[insects chirring]

49:43.525 --> 49:45.527
Fuckin' Johnny Viti
givin' me orders now?

49:45.527 --> 49:46.945
Sayin' I gotta clean up?

49:48.321 --> 49:49.656
It was supposed to be him
in this grave,

49:49.781 --> 49:51.116
not these two schmucks.

49:53.410 --> 49:54.494
Oh, man.

49:55.161 --> 49:56.413
[Victor grunts] Shit!

49:56.413 --> 49:58.665
[ominous music playing]

49:59.332 --> 50:02.002
Lay down, where you belong.

50:04.671 --> 50:06.297
Oz... look.

50:06.423 --> 50:07.549
Lay down! Now!

50:11.177 --> 50:12.303
[Victor] God.

50:14.097 --> 50:16.683
[groaning]

50:17.934 --> 50:19.519
How does it feel, Vic, huh?

50:20.103 --> 50:22.105
Nah! Hey, hey.
Don't close your eyes.

50:22.105 --> 50:23.565
Look at them. Remember this.

50:23.565 --> 50:26.067
This is what happens
when you choke, ya understand?

50:26.067 --> 50:27.736
Dead's a one-way street, Vic.

50:27.736 --> 50:30.405
You know how close I got
to getting popped tonight?

50:30.405 --> 50:31.489
'Cause you fucked up?

50:33.116 --> 50:35.035
Then I gotta plant the blade
and the jewels...

50:35.160 --> 50:36.494
Lotta work for me, Vic.

50:36.619 --> 50:39.581
- A lotta work.
- Look, I'm-I'm-I'm sorry, okay?

50:39.581 --> 50:40.582
- I mean it.
- You know what?

50:40.582 --> 50:41.875
Fuck apologizin'.

50:42.500 --> 50:45.003
You wanna survive?
You gotta adapt.

50:45.128 --> 50:46.629
Respond to the environment,
the situation,

50:46.629 --> 50:48.673
gotta think on your feet,
you gotta be quick.

50:48.798 --> 50:50.383
Otherwise, this is what happens.

50:51.134 --> 50:53.636
Whatever Carmine threw at me,
I delivered on.

50:53.636 --> 50:55.680
Every goddamn time!

50:57.307 --> 50:59.267
- You get what I'm saying?
- Yeah. Mm-hmm.

50:59.267 --> 51:00.435
- [Oz] Yeah?
- Mm-hmm.

51:08.902 --> 51:10.528
Ah, fuck it. Alright, come on.

51:10.653 --> 51:12.280
Get up, get up. Gimme your hand.

51:15.492 --> 51:17.035
[Victor grunting]

51:18.912 --> 51:20.538
There ain't no playbook
for this shit, kid.

51:21.498 --> 51:23.416
I saw somethin' in you.
Maybe I was wrong.

51:23.541 --> 51:24.751
You tell me.

51:24.876 --> 51:26.628
Maybe you ain't cut out
for this life.

51:26.628 --> 51:29.130
- [phone buzzing]
- You know?

51:29.130 --> 51:30.548
Who the fuck is calling me now?

51:32.008 --> 51:33.593
[music darkens]

51:34.594 --> 51:36.137
Cover the bodies.

51:38.556 --> 51:39.766
Hey, Sofia.

51:40.725 --> 51:41.726
How ya doin'?

51:43.395 --> 51:44.604
Uh-huh.

51:45.230 --> 51:46.398
Uh-huh.

51:48.066 --> 51:49.651
[music fades]

51:56.449 --> 51:59.494
[limping footsteps approaching]

52:19.389 --> 52:20.682
He killed my brother.

52:21.558 --> 52:23.601
A man I trusted,
working for them.

52:25.645 --> 52:26.604
Why?

52:27.272 --> 52:28.273
For what?

52:31.568 --> 52:32.819
Some diamonds.

52:33.486 --> 52:35.196
These were in Castillo's
apartment.

52:35.196 --> 52:37.115
It's what Alberto went to get
the night he died.

52:38.575 --> 52:39.951
As an investment in our future.

52:40.827 --> 52:42.120
In our new drug.

52:42.829 --> 52:44.622
We were going to run
the Family together.

52:45.582 --> 52:47.208
But Berto was taken from me.

52:48.752 --> 52:51.129
[clicks tongue] And I refuse
to let these old fucking men

52:51.254 --> 52:52.756
push me aside again,
like I'm nothing.

52:52.756 --> 52:54.466
So, I'm going to take
from them now.

52:55.008 --> 52:57.135
And I'm gonna force them
to their knees.

53:01.014 --> 53:03.141
It should be fun.
[laughs softly]

53:06.144 --> 53:07.479
What do you say, Oz?

53:08.438 --> 53:09.481
You in?

53:11.816 --> 53:12.984
Let's dance.

53:14.110 --> 53:19.324
["Happy Together"
by Floor Cry playing]

53:24.120 --> 53:26.664
♪ Imagine me and you ♪

53:26.664 --> 53:27.832
♪ I do ♪

53:28.375 --> 53:32.003
♪ I think about you
day and night ♪

53:32.128 --> 53:34.005
♪ It's only right ♪

53:34.130 --> 53:37.342
♪ To think about
the girl you love ♪

53:37.467 --> 53:39.260
♪ And hold her tight ♪

53:39.260 --> 53:44.516
♪ So happy together ♪

53:45.517 --> 53:47.936
♪ If I should call you up ♪

53:47.936 --> 53:49.938
♪ Invest a dime ♪

53:49.938 --> 53:53.316
♪ And you say
you belong to me ♪

53:53.316 --> 53:55.360
♪ And ease my mind ♪

53:55.360 --> 53:58.530
♪ Imagine how the world
could be ♪

53:58.655 --> 54:00.615
♪ So very fine ♪

54:00.615 --> 54:06.371
♪ So happy together ♪

54:07.539 --> 54:14.004
♪ I can't see me
lovin' nobody but you ♪

54:14.004 --> 54:17.674
♪ For all my life ♪

54:18.383 --> 54:21.553
♪ When you're with me, baby ♪

54:21.678 --> 54:24.639
♪ The skies'll be blue ♪

54:24.639 --> 54:28.476
♪ For all my life ♪

54:52.542 --> 54:57.422
[tense, dramatic
theme music playing]
